  "template_meta": {
    "blurb": "Farms one boss: enters its dungeon, defeats it, exits and repeats, selling and refilling potions between runs.\n\nIf the entrance zone is not in the list, choose the nearest zone that is, and add navigation nodes from there to the entrance. Check what Quicksell keeps before a long run.",
